@startuml
!include _style.iuml
[*] --> PENDING_PAYMENT : checkout (CARD / UPI / NETBANKING)
[*] --> CONFIRMED : checkout (COD)
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CONFIRMED : PaymentSucceeded
PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : customer cancels /\npayment window expires
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPED : admin ships\n(carrier + tracking no.)
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : customer cancels\n(refund issued)
SHIPPED --> OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
SHIPPED --> DELIVERED
OUT_FOR_DELIVERY --> DELIVERED
DELIVERED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
note right of CANCELLED : stock released,\nOrderCancelled event
@enduml
